  "Name": "FT_RECEIVE",
  "Description": "FT_RECEIVE\n\nReceiving process using the navigateToStep and navigateToStepButton in webtemplates.\nCustomer has items that require EAN barcode scanning, and a barcode may belong to multiple items codes.\nThe process looks at MasterItem Type (LabelType) to determine if barcode scan is required or not.\nIf no LabelType items exist - jump to Masteritem step and enter Qty.\nIf LabelType is valid - scan EANBarcode and validate - update MasterItem step and Qty for the EANBarcode and LabelType scanned.\n\nA rule defined in SystemStaticData - validates LabelType which require EANBarcode scan",
